00:01:16.320 --> 00:01:17.800
on the booster stage.

00:01:18.460 --> 00:01:21.180
Mobile networks failed across affected regions

00:01:21.180 --> 00:01:22.800
during the Spain wildfires.

00:01:23.640 --> 00:01:25.900
Starlink provided direct to cell texting

00:01:25.900 --> 00:01:28.940
at no charge to users in the impacted areas.

00:01:29.380 --> 00:01:32.260
The activation demonstrates operational direct

00:01:32.260 --> 00:01:35.080
to cell capability under emergency conditions.

00:01:35.640 --> 00:01:38.620
The service routed messages through the existing constellation

00:01:38.620 --> 00:01:41.180
without requiring new hardware on the ground.

00:01:41.960 --> 00:01:44.040
The agency selected Falcon Heavy

00:01:44.040 --> 00:01:45.920
after reviewing vehicle options

00:01:45.920 --> 00:01:48.240
for the Sunrise Solar Storm mission.

00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:51.320
Sunrise will study solar radio bursts

00:01:51.320 --> 00:01:53.560
from multiple vantage points in orbit.

00:01:54.280 --> 00:01:58.080
The change places the payload on space X's heavy lift manifest.

00:01:58.840 --> 00:02:01.220
The mission requires simultaneous observations

00:02:01.220 --> 00:02:04.140
that a single smaller vehicle cannot provide.

00:02:04.740 --> 00:02:07.740
The cursor test paired a high performance planner model

00:02:07.740 --> 00:02:11.700
with lower cost execution models for an SQL tie benchmark.

00:02:12.480 --> 00:02:14.540
Output quality remained comparable

00:02:14.540 --> 00:02:17.020
while inference spend dropped sharply.

00:02:17.660 --> 00:02:20.360
The result illustrates how agent architectures

00:02:20.360 --> 00:02:23.000
can compress large-scale coding workloads.

00:02:23.720 --> 00:02:26.360
The benchmark used an SQL tie task

00:02:26.360 --> 00:02:29.340
that previously required full frontier model rooting

00:02:29.340 --> 00:02:30.580
for every substep.

00:02:31.080 --> 00:02:34.560
The update adds the Q402 model directly

00:02:34.560 --> 00:02:36.060
to the cursor environment.

00:02:36.520 --> 00:02:39.460
Developers can select it for agent-based coding tasks

00:02:39.460 --> 00:02:40.840
without leaving the editor.

00:02:41.480 --> 00:02:44.620
The release expands model choice within the same workflow.

00:02:45.220 --> 00:02:47.280
The integration allows seamless switching

00:02:47.280 --> 00:02:49.460
between planning and execution models

00:02:49.460 --> 00:02:50.820
during a single session.

00:02:51.520 --> 00:02:54.820
City officials reviewed how XAI tax revenue

00:02:54.820 --> 00:02:56.920
will be allocated at the Memphis site.

00:02:57.520 --> 00:02:59.400
The talks follow ongoing construction

00:02:59.400 --> 00:03:01.600
of large-scale compute facilities.

00:03:02.080 --> 00:03:05.060
Local government adjustments accompany the project's growth.

00:03:05.840 --> 00:03:09.200
The administrative shakeup includes new personnel assignments

00:03:09.200 --> 00:03:11.540
tied directly to the data center timeline.

00:03:12.280 --> 00:03:17.140
Falcon 9 Booster B1081 is scheduled for its 26th flight

00:03:17.140 --> 00:03:20.860
on the Starlink 17-52 mission from Vandenberg.

00:03:21.480 --> 00:03:24.320
The mission will deploy another batch of Starlink satellites.

00:03:25.000 --> 00:03:27.120
The pad turnaround stands at three days.

00:03:27.520 --> 00:03:30.100
The Booster will attempt a landing on the drone ship

00:03:30.860 --> 00:03:32.660
OCIESY after separation.

